{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SpectralGraphTheory\/documentation\/SpectralGraphTheory\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/laplacianEigenpairs(largest:tolerance:maxIterations:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"laplacianEigenpairs","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"largest","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tolerance","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd"},{"text":" = 1e-8, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"maxIterations","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":"? = nil) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"NoConvergence","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/NoConvergence","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols13NoConvergenceV"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Eigenpairs","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/SpectralGraphTheory\/documentation\/SpectralGraphTheory\/Eigenpairs","preciseIdentifier":"s:19SpectralGraphTheory10EigenpairsV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The number of eigenpairs, in "},{"code":"0...vertexCount","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"largest"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The residual a Ritz pair must reach, relative as described above.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"tolerance"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"